     "explanation": "On foot is the fixed phrase à pied — singular, with à. En is reserved for vehicles you board: en train, en voiture, en bus. So \"en pied\" is wrong, and by the same rule \"à train\" would need to be en train.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">EN OR A - PICK THE PAIR</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"140\" width=\"420\" height=\"420\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><rect x=\"170\" y=\"260\" width=\"280\" height=\"110\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"230\" cy=\"395\" r=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><circle cx=\"390\" cy=\"395\" r=\"28\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><rect x=\"190\" y=\"280\" width=\"70\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.25)\"/><rect x=\"280\" y=\"280\" width=\"70\" height=\"45\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"rgba(59,130,246,0.25)\"/><text x=\"310\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#3b82f6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">___ voiture ?</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"140\" width=\"420\" height=\"420\" rx=\"14\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"790\" cy=\"240\" r=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"790\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"790\" y2=\"370\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"790\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"740\" y2=\"345\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"790\" y1=\"300\" x2=\"840\" y2=\"345\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"790\" y1=\"370\" x2=\"745\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><line x1=\"790\" y1=\"370\" x2=\"835\" y2=\"440\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"5\"/><text x=\"790\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">___ pied ?</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"620\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"680\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE RULE IN ONE LINE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"730\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Board it, or power it yourself?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">One preposition for each - which goes where?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"900\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"24\">Je vais au travail ___ ___ .</text></svg>",
      "caption": "A car you board and legs that carry you: each picture pairs with a different preposition."
     }
