     "explanation": "The order is subject, ne, pronoun, verb, pas: Je ne me lève pas tôt. Ne comes before the reflexive pronoun, pas comes after the verb, and me stays glued to lève — the negative wraps around the pronoun-verb block, never inside it.",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PUT THE PIECES IN ORDER</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"140\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"28\">I do not get up early.</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"190\" width=\"920\" height=\"320\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.1)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">YOUR TILES</text><rect x=\"130\" y=\"290\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(136,136,136,0.2)\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"190\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">Je</text><rect x=\"280\" y=\"290\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"340\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ne</text><rect x=\"430\" y=\"290\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"490\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">me</text><rect x=\"580\" y=\"290\" width=\"150\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"655\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">leve</text><rect x=\"760\" y=\"290\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"820\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">pas</text><rect x=\"910\" y=\"290\" width=\"70\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"rgba(136,136,136,0.2)\" stroke=\"#888\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"945\" y=\"340\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">tot</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">shuffled here on purpose - the answer options</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"465\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">arrange them in four different orders</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"560\" width=\"920\" height=\"420\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.1)\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"625\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#14b8a6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">TWO ANCHORS TO HOLD ONTO</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">1. The pronoun never leaves its verb's side.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">2. The negative wraps around the outside</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"835\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"24\">of that block - never inside it.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"22\">Which option respects both anchors?</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Six shuffled tiles and two anchor rules — the pronoun stays with its verb, and the negative wraps outside the block"
     }
