"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CARIBBEAN</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">and the Pacific</text><text x=\"900\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">islands</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"170\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Vous n'avez pas fini un cours.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"208\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Vous avez commence une langue.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">(commence written with an acute accent on the final e)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1060\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"30\">The road is open.</text></svg>",
